`expr.`: expressions of two operations or more found in the graphs. `tiled`: those a kernel was planned for.
`fused nodes`: nodes computed inside a kernel call instead of by a call of their own. `given up`: kernel calls not
made, or dropped, because of the arrays' layout or a floating-point exception NumPy reports. `whole writes`,
`part writes`: writes computed by one NumPy call instead of a copy and a call. `MB written`: results the calls wrote.

